{"html": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Wind and The Wisp</i></strong> is an adventure game about two best friends. One who has passed away and awoken as a ghost in a mysterious broken garden. And one who is still alive and misses their friend dearly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the combination of traditional input methods and the power of your breath, control both characters and join them on their journey through grief as they bridge the divide and bring life and structure back to the broken garden together. The Wind and the Wisp is a story about love and loss, and seeks to build a sense of connection in the wake of loneliness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovable little ghost character, the Wisp! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/5407b043c191b512c183b84b7ff7f59c.poster.avif?t=1755123874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/5407b043c191b512c183b84b7ff7f59c.webm?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/5407b043c191b512c183b84b7ff7f59c.mp4?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow into the microphone to trigger Wind and interact with the world and the Wisp!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/2a4d1d895e5962789f0c676c56152b5a.poster.avif?t=1755123874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/2a4d1d895e5962789f0c676c56152b5a.webm?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/2a4d1d895e5962789f0c676c56152b5a.mp4?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles by blowing into the microphone and activating unique flower mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/ba511d29fdb0e078790d5ac246da7baf.poster.avif?t=1755123874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/ba511d29fdb0e078790d5ac246da7baf.webm?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729770/extras/ba511d29fdb0e078790d5ac246da7baf.mp4?t=1755123874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world to explore with hidden interactions!</p></li></ul>"}